<title>USA: Standard Microsystems names acting CFO.</title>
<headline>Standard Microsystems names acting CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Microsystems Corp said Thursday that Eric Nowling, its vice president and controller, will also be serving as acting chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Nowling replaces Anthony D'Agostino, who is leaving to join ProCommunications Inc, a provider of inbound call center services, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said Nowling will be acting chief financial officer until a permanent CFO is appointed.</p>
</text>
